---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { LOCALES, type Locale } from '@/utils/i18n';
export function getStaticPaths() { return LOCALES.map(locale => ({ params: { locale } })); }
const { locale } = Astro.params as { locale: Locale };
const zh = locale === 'zh';
---
<BaseLayout locale={locale} title={zh ? '隐私说明' : 'Privacy notice'}>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none py-8">
    <h1>{zh ? '隐私说明' : 'Privacy notice'}</h1>
    {zh ? <>
      <p>本博客由 GitHub Pages 托管。浏览页面无需注册，也无需同意访问统计。</p>
      <h2>可选的访问统计</h2>
      <p>只有你选择“同意统计”后，网站才会加载 Google Analytics 4。它通过 Cookie 记录页面访问、访问来源、阅读参与度、滚动到页面约 90% 的位置和下载链接点击，用于改进文章内容与分享方式。这些数据只能作为阅读和下载意愿的参考。</p>
      <p>Google 会接收浏览器与设备信息、页面访问和交互数据，以及网络请求所包含的 IP 地址，并可能据此生成大致位置等信息。网站不会向 Analytics 主动提供姓名、邮箱或用户账号 ID；页面地址中的非推广查询参数和片段会被移除，来源页面只保留网站来源。请勿在分享链接的推广参数中填写个人信息。</p>
      <p>我们不关联 Google Ads，不开启 Google Signals，广告相关同意状态保持拒绝。用户与事件明细保留期设为两个月；汇总报表可能保留更久。统计 Cookie 的有效期设为 60 天，访问时可能续期。统计后台不会公开。</p>
      <h2>更改选择</h2>
      <p>你可以通过每页底部的“统计设置”同意或拒绝统计。选择仅保存在当前浏览器，最多记住 180 天。拒绝时不加载 Google 统计脚本；撤回后会停止后续统计并清除本网站可访问的 Analytics Cookie，已传送的数据不会因此自动删除。如果浏览器启用了 Global Privacy Control，我们也不会加载统计。</p>
      <button data-analytics-settings type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 px-4 py-2 dark:border-zinc-600">更改统计选择</button>
      <h2>托管与第三方服务</h2>
      <p>GitHub Pages 会处理提供网站所需的网络请求。点击外部链接后，相应网站会适用自己的隐私政策。</p>
      <p>更多信息：<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google 隐私政策</a>、<a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245">Analytics 数据保护说明</a>、<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub 隐私声明</a>。</p>
    </> : <>
      <p>This blog is hosted on GitHub Pages. No registration or consent to analytics is required to read it.</p>
      <h2>Optional visitor analytics</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics 4 loads only after you select “Allow analytics.” It uses cookies to measure page views, traffic sources, engagement, scrolling to approximately 90% of a page and download-link clicks, helping improve articles and distribution. These signals do not establish that an article was read or a download completed.</p>
      <p>Google receives browser and device information, page and interaction data, and the IP address included in network requests, which may be used to derive approximate location. We do not intentionally send names, email addresses or user account IDs to Analytics. Page URLs exclude non-campaign query parameters and fragments; referrers retain only the website origin. Please do not put personal information in campaign parameters.</p>
      <p>We do not link Google Ads or enable Google Signals. Advertising consent remains denied. User and event details are retained for two months; aggregate reports may be retained longer. Analytics cookies have a 60-day lifetime that may renew on visits. The reporting dashboard is not public.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>Use “Analytics settings” in the footer to allow or decline analytics. Your choice is stored only in this browser for up to 180 days. Declining prevents the Google analytics script from loading. Withdrawing consent stops future tracking and clears Analytics cookies accessible to this website; it does not automatically delete data already transmitted. We also do not load analytics when the browser enables Global Privacy Control.</p>
      <button data-analytics-settings type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 px-4 py-2 dark:border-zinc-600">Change analytics preferences</button>
      <h2>Hosting and third-party services</h2>
      <p>GitHub Pages processes network requests needed to serve this site. External websites apply their own privacy policies when you follow their links.</p>
      <p>More information: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245">Analytics data safeguards</a>, and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.</p>
    </>}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
